cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the article below."
title: "UE-Aware Cell Occupancy Inference from Partially Observable Cellular Control-Plane Data"
abstract: >-
  Simulator, estimators and experiment scripts for inferring the number of UEs
  physically present in a single LTE cell from control-plane observations, under
  cooperative network-side (Mode A) and passive air-interface (Mode B) regimes.
authors:
